"Vee is a reincarnated soul from another world, an [Experiment] of the goddess called Mother."
"Vee recalls little of her past life and thinks she was unhappy in it."
"Vee and Syl share Earth-like memories of sharks, fairytales and Christmas."
"Vee bears the [Experiment] and [Elven Legacy] Emblems."
"Vee's race cannot learn full telepathy; she speaks through a narrow arthropod telepathy."
"Vee's quests from the gods come to her through Syl's bond."
"Vee fears Qhilleeqeth, a servant of Mother, may have lied about her evolution path."
"Once she evolves, Vee may be able to carry messages to Mother."
"Vee knows every secret of Syl's, and calls the personas Syl's family."
